; Factions for players (doc 47, owner 2026-10-06).
; join: open            - anyone (loners; no leader)
;       contracts       - after `contracts` contracts of the contact, apply; leader/deputy accepts
;                         (no leader appointed yet: the contact accepts, i.e. any deputy/admin decision)
;       leader          - apply; only the leader or a deputy accepts
;       admin_or_leader - apply; only the leader or an admin accepts
;       auto            - nobody applies (renegades: the Zone decides)
; leader: no - the faction has no leader (loners)
; zone: the faction's safe zone(s) where the leader places items/furniture

